editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-007/source-tracking.stdout.log:1890:   120	"Whatever you are," he said, "I said I'm glad it's on my side of the floor. At the trial. When she stopped to read you." He toweled off. "The floor's about to be the whole continent, and I'm not on it — I'm staying; you know I'm staying; it's the right thing for me and you'd tell me so if I asked, which is why I'm not asking." He put out his hand, the third time in their lives. "Still glad. That's the whole thing. I made myself wait two years to fight you straight and it was worth every month, and I don't need to know what you are to know that. Go be it somewhere with more room."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-007/source-tracking.stdout.log:2897:   120	"Whatever you are," he said, "I said I'm glad it's on my side of the floor. At the trial. When she stopped to read you." He toweled off. "The floor's about to be the whole continent, and I'm not on it — I'm staying; you know I'm staying; it's the right thing for me and you'd tell me so if I asked, which is why I'm not asking." He put out his hand, the third time in their lives. "Still glad. That's the whole thing. I made myself wait two years to fight you straight and it was worth every month, and I don't need to know what you are to know that. Go be it somewhere with more room."
