   101	*The ninth, if it comes. It may not. I'm not to make it come; that's the first rule, and it's kept. He asked. Nobody put the asking in his mouth. He wrote it on the back of a chart in wing three and kept it till the seat had done with me.*
   102	
   103	*In earnest: yes. He'll put his lath down if I give him less. Awake, and on purpose: yes. I'm writing this the night before, with a pen, and I know exactly what I'm about.*
